1 REM === t26_override.bpp ===
2 REM Tests: OVERRIDE SET/CLEAR/LIST
3 DIALECT "GWBS"
10 TEST "OVERRIDE SET"
20 OVERRIDE SET BEEP = "REM beep suppressed"
30 REM Override active, BEEP becomes REM
40 BEEP
50 OVERRIDE CLEAR BEEP
60 ENDTEST
100 TEST "OVERRIDE CLEAR"
110 OVERRIDE SET BEEP = "REM beep suppressed"
120 OVERRIDE CLEAR BEEP
130 REM Should be cleared now
140 ENDTEST
200 TEST "OVERRIDE LIST"
210 OVERRIDE SET BEEP = "REM beep suppressed"
220 OVERRIDE LIST
230 OVERRIDE CLEAR BEEP
240 ENDTEST
999 END
